= Homosexual Rights

Our queer community is rather small compared to some other change and thus requires positive action to highlight and promote it. For some reason Tbgoes and the HP is a big supporter of this due to Tbs obsession with lesbians.

- @reform_183: Dump chemicals into the water
- @change_sex: Promote our queer community
- @return: Do not enact any changes for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

